{"turn_id": "d26-t1", "session_id": "d26", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "overall_metrics", "text": "评估使用了宏观精确率（macro precision）、召回率（recall）和 F-1 值作为评价指标。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "out_of_context_eval", "text": "针对脱离上下文的问题（out-of-context questions），系统在 Bench'It 数据集（150 个法语常识开放问题）上进行评估，取得宏观精确率 64.14%、召回率 64.33% 和 F-1 值 63.46%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "coref_eval", "text": "共指消解模型在 CALOR 测试集上评估，取得平均精确率 65.59%、召回率 48.86% 和 F-1 值 55.77%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "scope", "text": "论文指出对系统各组成部分的评估是在本工作范围之外完成的，本文只评估了脱离上下文的问题以及共指消解模块。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d26-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d26-t2", "session_id": "d26", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "eval_scope", "text": "论文指出，对系统各组成部分的评估是在本工作范围之外完成的；论文只评估了脱离上下文的问题以及共指消解模块。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "ooc_dataset", "text": "脱离上下文问题的性能在 Bench'It 上评估，该数据集包含150个关于法语常识的开放式问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "ooc_metrics", "text": "在该评估中，系统达到宏观精确率64.14%、召回率64.33%和F-1值63.46%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "coref_dataset", "text": "共指消解模型在CALOR测试集上进行了评估。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "coref_metrics", "text": "共指消解模型取得平均精确率65.59%、召回率48.86%和F-1值55.77%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "coref_english", "text": "同一模型在英语上达到平均F-1值68.8%，而法语没有可比的测量结果。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-25081376dc5c3d8bd7d1b8ff"}]}, {"key": "las_metric", "text": "在语言模块的测试中，通过人工标注约500个问题并合并入UD树库，标记依存分数（LAS）绝对提升了10%，达到92%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.11980", "chunk_id": "c-8774c64ccb9a5d93a5c4301c"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d26-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
